Z||000000||Monkeyman||11-28-2001||05:47 PM||||Yes, I searched.  Do you know how many headlight threads there are?<P>I just rebuilt my drivers side motor.  (Bad gear.)  I reinstalled it in my car just like it came out.  Now it will go up, but not down.  I thought I knew something about this (this isn't the 1<sup>st</sup> headlight motor I've either changed out or rebuilt), but I can't figure it out.  When I try to crank the headlight down manually (with the blue wire still attached), it wants to raise up again.<P>I'd like to get this fixed before I go nuts!  (I've been about halfway there for years.)<P><B>HELP</B><P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/patriot.gif">    <BR><B><FONT COLOR="red">Proud</FONT> <FONT COLOR="white">to be an</FONT> <FONT COLOR="blue">American</FONT>!!</B>||||reg||8
